{
 "post_id": "var-livres-3",
 "slides": {
  "1": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "5 things i did that fixed my",
      "phone addiction"
     ],
     "texte": "5 libros que se leen como si fueran una [[serie]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "(from 14 hours",
      "screen time to 3)"
     ],
     "texte": "(imposible soltarlos, lo juro)"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_070d9d6c.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "2": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "make decisions before you feel ready"
     ],
     "texte": "1. [[Crónica de una muerte anunciada]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "there will never be a",
      "perfect moment, you will",
      "never feel ready"
     ],
     "texte": "García Márquez. desde la página 1 sabes que lo van a matar"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "take that risk you've",
      "been thinking about, you",
      "have nothing to lose"
     ],
     "texte": "todo el pueblo lo sabía y nadie lo avisó. [[necesitas saber por qué]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "procrastination is making you lose trust in yourself"
     ],
     "texte": "apenas 120 páginas, se lee como [[una novela negra]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0d90650e.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "let yourself be bored"
     ],
     "texte": "2. [[Buenos días, tristeza]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "every queue, walk and",
      "bathroom break gets filled",
      "with input now"
     ],
     "texte": "Sagan lo escribió con 18 años. un verano en la Costa Azul"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "that sounds harmless, but",
      "you're removing every",
      "chance your attention has",
      "to sit still"
     ],
     "texte": "Cécile tiene 17, su vida es perfecta hasta que llega Anne. entonces [[arma un plan]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "spend 20–30 minutes a day with no podcast,",
      "music, scrolling or second screen"
     ],
     "texte": "la odias, la entiendes, y sigues pasando y pasando páginas [[sin poder parar]]"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "listen to your thoughts"
     ],
     "texte": "[[una sola noche]] y listo"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0ba43121.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1504,
       2784
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "4": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "learn to tolerate boring repetition"
     ],
     "texte": "3. [[Fahrenheit 451]], Ray Bradbury"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "most success is less",
      "exciting than it looks"
     ],
     "texte": "un mundo donde los bomberos [[queman libros]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "it’s doing the same",
      "useful things for",
      "months after the",
      "novelty disappears"
     ],
     "texte": "Montag quema libros cada día, hasta que una noche se guarda uno y [[empieza a leer]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "consistency gets powerful when other people get bored",
      "and move on"
     ],
     "texte": "escrito en 1953, y habla [[de nosotros y nuestras pantallas]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_38d562a6.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "5": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "scrolling whenever you're bored"
     ],
     "texte": "4. [[Carta de una desconocida]], Zweig"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "you can lose 2–3 hours a day without even noticing,",
      "then wonder why you have no time for the things you",
      "care about"
     ],
     "texte": "un escritor recibe la carta de una mujer que ni recuerda. lo ama en secreto desde los 13 años y [[se lo cuenta todo]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "be deliberate with your",
      "time."
     ],
     "texte": "menos de 100 páginas, [[un golpe]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i personally use readup to",
      "block tiktok until i read for",
      "20 minutes, which keeps",
      "me from mindlessly scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "y por la noche, antes hacía scroll sin parar, y ahora aprendo algo nuevo en 5 min con [[la app Sophia]]"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "your phone can wait until",
      "you have done one thing",
      "you meant to do."
     ],
     "texte": "ayer tocó por qué el cielo es azul. todavía se lo cuento a todo el mundo"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": "sophia_capture"
   }
  },
  "6": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "wake up before everyone else"
     ],
     "texte": "5. [[El gran Gatsby]], Fitzgerald"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "no messages, no notifications, no one needs you yet"
     ],
     "texte": "fiestas enormes cada noche y un anfitrión [[que nadie conoce]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "the first hour of the day is",
      "when your focus is at its",
      "best, so use it for your",
      "own goals"
     ],
     "texte": "tiene la mansión, el dinero, las fiestas, pero solo quiere [[una cosa]] al otro lado de la bahía"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "before anyone else can",
      "take your attention"
     ],
     "texte": "cuanto más avanzas, [[más se resquebraja todo]]"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "even 30 minutes earlier makes a difference"
     ],
     "texte": "menos de 200 páginas, [[un fin de semana]]"
    }
   },
